{
  "sn12.20:0.1": "Linked Discourses 12.20 ",
  "sn12.20:0.2": "2. Fuel ",
  "sn12.20:0.3": "Conditions ",
  "sn12.20:1.1": "At Sāvatthī. ",
  "sn12.20:1.2": "“Mendicants, I will teach you dependent origination and dependently originated phenomena. ",
  "sn12.20:1.3": "Listen and apply your mind well, I will speak.” ",
  "sn12.20:1.4": "“Yes, sir,” they replied. ",
  "sn12.20:1.5": "The Buddha said this: ",
  "sn12.20:2.1": "“And what is dependent origination? ",
  "sn12.20:2.2": "Rebirth is a requirement for old age and death. ",
  "sn12.20:2.3": "Whether Realized Ones arise or not, this law of nature persists, this regularity of natural principles, this surety of natural principles, specific conditionality. ",
  "sn12.20:2.4": "A Realized One awakens to this and comprehends it, ",
  "sn12.20:2.5": "then he explains, teaches, asserts, establishes, clarifies, analyzes, and discloses it. ",
  "sn12.20:2.6": "‘Look,’ he says, ",
  "sn12.20:2.7": "‘Rebirth is a requirement for old age and death.’ ",
  "sn12.20:3.1": "Continued existence is a requirement for rebirth … ",
  "sn12.20:3.2": "Grasping is a requirement for continued existence … ",
  "sn12.20:3.3": "Craving is a requirement for grasping … ",
  "sn12.20:3.4": "Feeling is a requirement for craving … ",
  "sn12.20:3.5": "Contact is a requirement for feeling … ",
  "sn12.20:3.6": "The six sense fields are requirements for contact … ",
  "sn12.20:3.7": "Name and form are requirements for the six sense fields … ",
  "sn12.20: